<!doctype html><html><head><title>Posts</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body><nav><a href="/">Posts</a></nav><article><h1>Posts live in a file</h1><p>The server reads this file on the first request that needs it.</p><p>Comments are kept in memory only.</p></article><h2 id="comments">0 comments</h2><ul class="comments"></ul><form method="post" action="/posts/on-files"><label>Name <input name="name" maxlength="80" value=""></label> <label>Comment <textarea name="body" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label> <button>Post</button></form></body></html>